@startuml 02a_state_application
!include _style.iuml
title RishFlow – State Machine: Application Lifecycle

[*] --> Splash : launch app
Splash : entry / start pywebview window & tray icon
Splash : do / load saved state (state.json)

Splash --> Welcome : splash done [not logged in]
Splash --> Main : splash done [session restored]

Welcome : do / show Login screen
Welcome --> Onboarding : login / guest [first run]
Welcome --> Main : login [profile exists]

Onboarding : do / collect profile, workspace, focus types
Onboarding --> Main : finish / save_state(user_profile)

state "Main Application" as Main {
  [*] --> Dashboard
  state Dashboard
  state FileOrganizer
  state Categories
  state AISearch
  state ActivityLog
  state Settings

  Dashboard --> FileOrganizer : select "Organizer"
  Dashboard --> Categories : select "Categories"
  Dashboard --> AISearch : select "AI Search"
  Dashboard --> ActivityLog : select "Activity"
  Dashboard --> Settings : select "Settings"
  FileOrganizer --> Dashboard : select "Dashboard"
  Categories --> Dashboard : select "Dashboard"
  AISearch --> Dashboard : select "Dashboard"
  ActivityLog --> Dashboard : select "Dashboard"
  Settings --> Dashboard : select "Dashboard"
}

Main --> HiddenInTray : close window / hide()
HiddenInTray : do / keep running in system tray
HiddenInTray --> Main : tray "Open RishFlow" / show()
HiddenInTray --> [*] : tray "Exit" / stop icon, destroy window
@enduml
